<title>HONG KONG: Amoy Properties year net up slightly.</title>
<headline>Amoy Properties year net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   63.3    vs 66.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    28.5    vs 28.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    1,580.4 vs 1,548.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,426.5 vs 2,434.1</p>
<p>    Company name		 Amoy Properties Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 11-15</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   November 29</p>
<p>NOTE - Amoy Properties, a 57.71 percent owned subsidiary of Hang Lung Development Co Ltd, engages in property investment.</p>
<p>Share earnings are based on a weighted average of 2.5 billion ordinary shares vs 2.3 billion.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 43.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 15 cents) vs 42.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
